## Level 1 layout, drawn as text so it is easy to read and edit.
##
## Every character is one 32x32 tile. Rows are listed top to bottom.
##
##   #  earth with grass             S  ancient stone ruins
##   .  empty air                    P  player start
##   *  Echo Shard (collectible)     C  checkpoint (numbered left to right)
##   E  Shade Crawler (patrol enemy) ^  obsidian thorns (spikes)
##   v  orb that moves up and down   h  orb that moves left and right
##   t  hint tablet (text below)     O  the end portal

